## Verdict on the preregistered question

Work per energy under Omni against native: 44.52 -> 43.79 served requests per kJ, difference -0.7345 (95% interval -1.451 to -0.01807).
Guardrails: requests served held (not below -1%), 95th-percentile response time held (not above +10%), requests not served held (not above +1% of native served).
Observation (watch against native) on the same outcome: power given, not beyond the noise. Authority (omni against watch): GAIN, not beyond the noise.
**Result, by rule: LOSS.**

